    - rid: 3001
      type: {class: DialogLineNode, ns: NPC.Dialog, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        guid: clerk_greeting
        position: {x: -582, y: -235}
        title: ClerkGreeting
        text: Welcome, stranger. How can I help you?
        choices:
        - id: clerk_greeting_1
          text: I want to register for the entrance exam.
          nextNodeGuid: 63d5b1a661cc4887a6873af345067ba2
          lockMode: 1
          conditions: []
        - id: clerk_greeting_3
          text: No. Bye
          nextNodeGuid: 
          lockMode: 0
          conditions: []
    - rid: 3002
      type: {class: DialogLineNode, ns: NPC.Dialog, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        guid: clerk_exam_req
        position: {x: -14, y: -242}
        title: ClerkExamRequirements
        text: To be eligible for the exam, you must know at least one magic symbol
          and possess the official job of Wizard. Once you achieve these, return
          to me and I will issue your exam voucher.
        choices:
        - id: clerk_exam_req_1
          text: How do I become a Wizard?
          nextNodeGuid: clerk_wizard_job_info
          lockMode: 0
          conditions:
          - rid: 7769315388327723079
          - rid: 7769315406136737877
        - id: clerk_exam_req_2
          text: Where can I learn a magic symbol?
          nextNodeGuid: clerk_symbol_info
          lockMode: 0
          conditions: []
        - id: clerk_exam_req_3
          text: I'm ready for the exam
          nextNodeGuid: 11630bd0acba42e181ee7ac39fce4213
          lockMode: 0
          conditions:
          - rid: 7769315410981158999
          - rid: 7769315410981159000
          - rid: 7769315410981159001
        - id: 39bc8c726a6c476f8f977790c54285c3
          text: Thank you, I'll return when I'm ready.
          nextNodeGuid: 
          lockMode: 0
          conditions: []
    - rid: 3003
      type: {class: DialogLineNode, ns: NPC.Dialog, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        guid: clerk_wizard_job_info
        position: {x: 757, y: -295}
        title: ClerkWizardJobInfo
        text: To become a Wizard, you must first declare your path and accept the
          responsibilities that come with wielding magic.If you are certain, I can
          grant you the official status of Wizard right now.
        choices:
        - id: clerk_job_info_1
          text: Yes, I am ready to become a Wizard
          nextNodeGuid: 2c05bd6b303040c380e32e02c7c09421
          lockMode: 0
          conditions: []
        - id: clerk_job_info_2
          text: No, I don't want to be a Wizard
          nextNodeGuid: 
          lockMode: 0
          conditions: []
    - rid: 3004
      type: {class: DialogLineNode, ns: NPC.Dialog, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        guid: clerk_symbol_info
        position: {x: 755, y: -56}
        title: ClerkSymbolInfo
        text: 'To learn your first symbol, you must seek out one of our Academy teachers.
          Each of them can guide you through the process of mastering a basic rune.

          However,
          be warned: it is not enough to simply watch. You will need to go through
          the learning process yourself practice, focus, and prove that you can draw
          the symbol correctly.

          Only then will the knowledge truly be
          yours'
        choices:
        - id: clerk_symbol_info_1
          text: Thank you, I'll go find a teacher.
          nextNodeGuid: 
          lockMode: 0
          conditions: []
